Was KNOWNBUG since round 152 ("symbol 'ts' is unknown").  Fixed 2026-09-24:
N5008 [expr.prim.pack.index] -- at instantiation the pack-index-expression
`ts...[N]` (the parser marks the index node with `ellipsis`) is replaced by
the N-th expanded parameter, N a converted constant expression that may name
`sizeof...(ts)`; over a one-element pack it is the sole parameter.
